-- ============================================================
-- Sightings Artificial Seed Data
-- Covers Mythic (50 pts), Rare (20 pts), and Common (10 pts) scoring tiers.
-- Scoring: PointValue = 10 × RarityMultiplier
--   Mythic  (≤  5 global sightings): 5.0× = 50 pts
--   Rare   (≤ 50 global sightings): 2.0× = 20 pts
--   Common (>  50 global sightings): 1.0× = 10 pts
--
-- Species (no overlap with AcceptanceTestSeeder):
--   MYTHIC  – Beaver (4 sightings)  Mountain Lion (3 sightings)
--   RARE    – Black Bear (12 sightings)  Osprey (8 sightings)
--   COMMON  – Mallard Duck (55 sightings)  Eastern Gray Squirrel (52 sightings)
--
-- All 72 images sourced from iNaturalist (research-grade observations).
-- All verified Medium quality tier (sharpness ≥ 100, luminance 0.20–0.85, ≤ 2 MB).
--
-- Prerequisites: the following users must exist in AspNetUsers:
--   df6405d9-0dfb-415d-b77b-c779cecd000c  jd@waid.internal
--   74e0f665-41e5-42dc-9681-0501f6eb392a  marquis@waid.internal
